WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.360
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:13.700
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:17.280
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.830
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.420
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:29.050
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.680
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.310
by ridding you...

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:43.480
...of your other love?

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:48.060
At sunset,

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:50.570
when the children go home,

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:54.530
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:58.410
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:00.490
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:04.290
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:09.960
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:11.750
In a city without light,

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.680
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.100
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.350
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:24.850
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:36.570
I'm Kurata Sana, a sixth grader,
who's also a TV personality.

00:01:36.570 --> 00:01:40.240
Mama. An Aoki Laureate novelist.
The chipmunk on her head is Maro-chan.

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:43.910
Sagami Rei-kun. He's my manager,
as well as my boyfriend and pimp.

00:01:43.910 --> 00:01:45.750
His past girlfriend,
Kurumi Asako-san, showed up,

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:48.250
and now, our relationship
has cooled off a little.

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:49.250
Ah, who cares about this guy?

00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:51.250
My name has been settled on,
so give me a proper introduction!

00:01:51.250 --> 00:01:52.210
Babbit.

00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:54.590
Geez, what a perfunctory introduction!

00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:57.760
And this is the
problem child Hayama Akito,

00:01:57.760 --> 00:01:59.930
who is causing trouble yet again!

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:05.520
I'm sorry. I didn't
mean for this to happen.

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:07.810
Hayama, how about we
go wash your face?

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:18.150
"Pinch, Pinch, Sana's Love"

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:44.930
What did you just do!?

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:47.270
It's your own fault for
getting your face so close.

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:49.270
What do you mean by that!?

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:52.610
What's with you? Don't get all
worked up over something like this.

00:02:52.610 --> 00:02:54.610
You've got a 20-year-old boyfriend,

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:57.280
so something like this
shouldn't be anything to you.

00:02:57.280 --> 00:03:00.610
R- Rei-kun told me to
reserve my first kiss for him,

00:03:00.610 --> 00:03:02.280
and I had been saving my lips!

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:03.950
Is that right?

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:05.950
She's never been kissed.

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:06.950
He looks like he's going to snap!

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:09.960
Keep it together, Tsuyoshi!
This isn't the classroom!

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:10.960
Sana-chan!

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:11.960
Going up.

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:13.880
J- just a second!

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:16.420
Maybe I'm just imagining it,
that's what I think,

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:18.630
but I thought I should confirm
that she's safe with my own two eyes.

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:20.680
I got this strong,
foreboding feeling, you know?

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:22.180
Sana-chan is up
in the observation lounge,

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:23.720
and it was like she called out to me.

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:28.980
I'm surprised you consider him
your boyfriend, if that's the case.

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:31.890
You're just being toyed with.
Figure it out already, you idiot.

00:03:31.890 --> 00:03:33.560
Wha--

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:36.230
--Idiot...!?
--I hear that Hayama-san's first kiss
came when he was in kindergarten.

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:39.240
--Wha-- wha--
--That figures.

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:40.740
--What do you mean by that!?
--Keep it together, Tsuyoshi!

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:41.650
--What do you mean by that!?
--I'm getting out of here.

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:43.200
--What do you mean by that!?
--Ah, it's no use!

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:53.920
Sana-chan, it's too dangerous here!

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:55.750
We'll be caught in the middle!

00:03:57.590 --> 00:04:00.300
A... ki... to... -kun...

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:05.260
Akito-kun!

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:07.600
Akito-kun! Akito-kun!

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:12.270
--Sana-chan...
--Ah, what a mess.

00:04:12.270 --> 00:04:13.600
Let's straighten this up
and get out of here, quick.

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:16.270
Hold the elevator.

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:18.440
It's all ruined...

00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:26.280
Is Akito-kun...

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:29.620
...here?

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:31.750
Really?

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:44.130
"Hurry, Rei-kun!"

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:47.260
Sana-chan...

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:50.010
There are observation lounges
on both the north and south sides...

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:57.560
"Sorry and goodbye." What is this!?

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:57.560
"Sorry and goodbye.
Shinbo Elementary 6th Grade,
3rd Class"

00:04:57.560 --> 00:04:59.690
"Congratulations!
Social Studies Field Trip"

00:04:57.940 --> 00:04:59.650
Woo-hoo!

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:04.280
Sensei! Your manuscript, please!

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:05.990
Sensei!

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:08.870
Sensei...!

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:14.910
What's that? What is it?
What is it? Let's go see!

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:17.250
S- Sensei...

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:25.590
Mother... I'm sorry... Sana has
been deflowered, as a 6th grader...

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:31.260
--Huh? What? What happened to
your Social Studies field trip?
--Sensei... your manuscript...

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:33.770
I may never find a husband!

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:37.900
She stepped on Onda.

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:39.560
What has happened to my daughter?

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:42.070
"Sana-chan, radically blue"

00:05:42.570 --> 00:05:46.900
And after I made such a fuss
about Rei-kun and Asako-san...

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:49.070
I don't care if you are Asako-san,
this is wrong!

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:51.240
You keep your hands off of Rei-kun!

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:52.240
Oh, yow!

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:54.250
What is this!?

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:57.920
I just felt a little sorry for Hayama,
since he suffers from a fear of heights.

00:05:57.920 --> 00:06:00.250
I was an idiot to show him a
single blessed bit of compassion.

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:02.920
Are you sure about that?
This is blessed compassion.

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:05.260
I haven't even kissed Rei-kun.

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:09.220
But to have him, of all people,
be the one to rob me of my first kiss...

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:14.220
Brokenhearted, I'm left to turn to
my personality assessor for help.

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:18.270
What I feel like eating now?
Sea cucumber parfait...

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:21.270
If I was to compare my current mood
to a color? Sewer-water gray...

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:23.270
Okay, how about it? Ah, here it is.

00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:25.530
"Right now, you are a fickle woman,

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:28.280
being led around and toyed
with by two different men."

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:33.120
Oh, you don't say!
That is who I am, after all!

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:38.870
I've betrayed my beloved Rei-kun!

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:43.790
I'm an adulterer! I'm a mistress!
I might as well kill Hayama,

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:45.880
and then join him, chanting
"Grazie Péquignot, Kaijari Suigyo..."

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:48.090
Ah, hoop-hoop-de-hoop...

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:51.550
Hmm, I don't quite
understand all of this.

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:53.550
For the moment, I'd better
withdraw and start over.

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:55.560
Sensei, your manuscript, please!

00:06:57.890 --> 00:07:02.900
Why should I have to die
because of him? Don't be absurd!

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:05.900
"God and Buddha, please help me"

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:08.570
Finished!

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:11.910
Now then, bing-bing, to offer my prayer!

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:13.570
Okay!

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:18.290
♪ God and Buddha, help me,
help me, help me please! ♪

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:23.920
♪ God and Buddha, help me,
help me, help me please! ♪

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:25.920
♪ I really did it out of compassion, ♪

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:27.920
♪ So really, please
overlook what happened! ♪

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:29.920
♪ I don't consider it to be a kiss. ♪

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:31.880
♪ If possible, pretend it didn't happen. ♪

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:34.220
♪ If it's not possible,
still pretend it didn't happen. ♪

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:36.220
♪ God, Buddha, God and Buddha! ♪

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:38.220
♪ Buddha, God, mm-gara-ga! ♪

00:07:38.220 --> 00:07:39.890
♪ Rei-kun, I'm sorry, forgive me. ♪

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:42.230
♪ Forgive me, forgive me, forgive me! ♪

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:44.560
♪ Rei-kun, it didn't happen,
it was nothing! ♪

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:46.230
♪ I didn't mean any harm! ♪

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:49.440
--♪ Pretend like it didn't happen. ♪
--Onda, let go!
--I can't do that, Sensei!

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:51.400
--♪ What will I do if Rei-kun finds out? ♪
 --I'm so close to getting your manuscript,
--Hey, let go!

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:54.070
--♪ No, no, don't let him find out!
So please, God, Buddha, ♪
--so please...

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:56.910
--♪ Hear my humble request to you. ♪
--My daughter is in a state of emergency.
This is no time for work.

00:07:56.910 --> 00:07:58.910
♪ I ask you with all my heart. ♪

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:00.910
--♪ Where has my compassion gone to? ♪
--Is Sana-chan in there?

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:02.920
♪ Hayama, you idiot,
what have you done!? ♪

00:08:02.920 --> 00:08:04.920
♪ God, Buddha, Buddha! ♪

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:07.250
--♪ Buddha, Buddha, God! ♪
--Sana, are you okay?

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:09.260
--Yow! I bit my tongue!
--I was just at City Hall.

00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:10.260
Rei-kun!

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:13.260
We must have just missed each other.

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:16.260
I didn't know that there
were two observation lounges.

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:20.270
I can't bear to face Rei-kun.

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:21.980
"She made a face to face him."

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:25.940
I suddenly had this funny feeling,
and when I got to City Hall,

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:28.070
sure enough, I heard that
there had been a commotion

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:30.940
among the Social Studies field trip
students, and was worried about you.

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:33.150
I'm glad you're safe, Sana-chan.

00:08:35.870 --> 00:08:39.870
I wonder if Sana-chan is still
upset about me and Asako.

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:42.540
That's not it!

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:44.170
Curious...

00:08:57.890 --> 00:08:59.890
I wonder if Sana-chan is still up.

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:06.560
She's still angry, I guess.
I'll stop pressing it.

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:07.560
You pressed it, all right!

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:09.150
I saw you!

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:15.570
I'm a freshly hard-boiled Sana-chan!

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:17.450
This, that, the other,
and everything else--

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:21.240
it's all your fault, Hayama!

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:22.290
"Hayama Guard! Hey, hey!"

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:24.250
"6th Grade 3rd Class"

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:26.920
What are you making, Sana-chan?

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:31.920
Heh, so, you've arrived.
I call this... I call this...

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:35.550
...the Hayama guard!

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:39.220
As long as I have this on, Hayama...

00:09:39.220 --> 00:09:40.890
--...cannot for the life of him
--Maybe she's doing a little better.

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:44.560
--get close to me!
--This is Sana-chan's
way of being depressed.

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:48.150
A-ha! So, you're here, Hayama!

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:56.110
Did you see that, everyone!?
I prevented Hayama from getting near me!

00:09:57.860 --> 00:09:59.530
We can't get close to you, either!

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:00.910
Oh, that is a drawback.

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:02.540
However, that's not all...

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:05.580
I can't get through the door,
so I can't go to the bathroom!

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:07.870
How can this be!? I got up
at 4 o'clock to make this!

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:09.540
What if you turned it on its side?

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:11.250
You really are an idiot, aren't you?

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:14.590
Hayama! How can you call others idiots?

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:17.590
If you got up at 4 o'clock to make that,
you could be called an idiot.

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:20.930
And who the Deutsch is the
one who kissed this idiot?

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:23.220
Oh, now I've gone and
said something nonsensical.

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:33.860
It's so stupid, I'm speechless.

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:35.530
Sana-chan!

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:37.570
Are you okay?

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:44.200
Hayama-san, is it true you got
your first kiss in kindergarten?

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:46.200
Mm-hmm.

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:49.210
I took the cutest girl in class
out into the backyard, see?

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:50.540
That's Hayama-san for you!

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:53.880
I was there at the time! I bet 10 yen
on whether or not you could do it.

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:55.550
You've got to try everything
while you're still young--

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:57.880
Don't get so full of yourself!

00:10:57.880 --> 00:11:01.890
Does this mean that instead of being
the devil, you're a kissing fiend!?

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:03.930
Why did you kiss me, anyway?

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:06.350
"Class Roll 6th Grade 3rd Class"

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:07.220
Okay, that's enough.

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:10.560
Class has begun. Unless you let
me start, I'll knock you flat!

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:12.900
You've gotten strong,
haven't you, Mitsuya-sensei?

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:17.650
Oh, right! Before I forget,
here's this week's Sana-chan.

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:25.580
You're Tsuyoshi-kun, right?

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:29.160
Did anything unusual happen
at school yesterday?

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:34.130
Sana-chan was acting a little weird.

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:40.590
W- what the...?

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:45.180
If you're her boyfriend, then please,
do a decent job of protecting Sana-chan.

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:53.270
T- thank you so much.
I'll go ask someone else. Bye!

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:54.730
Okay, time to go home.

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:58.230
It was awful! It was like, "whoosh!"
Everyone felt sorry for Sana-chan!

00:11:58.230 --> 00:12:00.280
It was terrible!
Terrible! Right? Right?

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:00.950
Mm-hmm, mm-hmm!

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:03.950
Is that right? Thanks a lot.

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:05.620
Hayama...

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:07.280
Bring him here.

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:09.830
Bring Hayama here.

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:40.230
Hey.

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:41.570
Oh, it's the pimp.

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:42.570
Get in here!

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:44.950
Whoa! What the hell!?
This is kidnapping!

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:52.910
So,

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:55.580
you're Hayama-kun?

00:12:55.580 --> 00:13:00.050
I understand you kissed my daughter.

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:08.930
How do you think it makes a girl feel
to be suddenly kissed by someone, hmm?

00:13:09.260 --> 00:13:11.600
Can a grade-school kid
like you understand?

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:16.100
Did you ever think
about how she would feel?

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:22.110
I didn't want to have to use this.

00:13:25.280 --> 00:13:26.950
Sensei, whenever you're ready, okay!

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:29.280
Listen, I'm going to
tell you just one thing.

00:13:29.280 --> 00:13:32.410
Do it as often as you like.
It's quite enjoyable.

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:34.250
That's all.

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:36.920
That's all? Sensei,
you don't mean that, right?

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:40.250
Not to worry. I just wanted to
see this Hayama boy, after all.

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:42.500
--Shimura-san! There's still
some cake, right?
--Hmm? Shimura-san?

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:43.920
--Give the boy a piece.
--C- cake? Eh?

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:44.590
Right!

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:45.920
Right?

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:47.260
He kissed her!

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:49.680
--That's right!
--That's right!

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:55.600
I see, what nice eyes you have.
I like you.

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:58.940
See to it that you take good care
of my daughter from now on.

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:00.940
Might I ask you a question, too?

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:03.610
Oh! Hayama used polite language!

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:05.610
Hmm? What's on your mind?

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:07.860
Where does that chipmunk poop?

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:12.370
Here you go. Take your time.

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:16.040
Maro-chan, demonstrate for him.

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:21.290
Maro-chan, you see...

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:24.960
...is very neat, so he does not
excrete in the place where he sleeps.

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:27.970
Oh. I thought your head
was covered with poop.

00:14:27.970 --> 00:14:30.970
No, it's not covered with poop.

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:32.970
He ate the cake!

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:36.230
Thanks for the cake. Now then,
I'll be going home.

00:14:36.230 --> 00:14:37.230
Come back again, now.

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:38.560
Thanks for having me.

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:40.560
He's got pluck, huh? Fascinating.

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:43.570
He is still a child,
as far as that goes.

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:50.570
I'll put on a new face
before entering the house...

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:52.280
Okay, there!

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:57.580
Yow-ow-ow! The rubber band is
caught in my hair! Yow-ow-ow!

00:14:57.580 --> 00:14:58.580
Hold it!

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:01.580
How come you're
coming out of my house!?

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:06.380
Sunglasses-san brought me. See ya.

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:10.930
I haven't forgiven you,
not one bit, understand!?

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:13.720
Both for what you did yesterday,
as well as messing up our class!

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:16.270
I have no intention of
forgiving you! However...

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:19.940
I don't like having to use
any of my power being angry.

00:15:19.940 --> 00:15:22.400
So I'm going to consider
what happened yesterday

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:24.610
as though I was "bitten by the leopard,"
and forget about it.

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:25.940
Just don't do it again.

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:28.610
If a leopard bit you, you'd he dead.

00:15:28.610 --> 00:15:31.610
You keep out of it!!

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:34.910
No sooner do you say that
than you get angry again.

00:15:34.910 --> 00:15:37.200
Was it that unpleasant?

00:15:37.240 --> 00:15:41.540
Of course it was! I already have
someone I like-- my boyfriend, Rei-kun.

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:43.540
I know.

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:45.590
Excuse me!

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:55.600
Hey! What are you doing to our gate!?

00:15:57.890 --> 00:16:00.890
For Pete's sake... I just
don't understand him.

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:02.940
Welcome back, Sana.

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:04.480
I'm home.

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:08.610
"Zenjiro's "Child's Toy""

00:16:08.610 --> 00:16:10.610
Whassa matter, Sana-chan?

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:13.280
Nothing at all!

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:14.950
In that case, let's see your face!

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:17.620
The fans are awl gonna be disappointed
if they can't see your face, Sana-chan.

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:19.620
There's a reason I'm doing this.

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:20.620
A reason, huh?

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:22.660
--Sana-chan, you're just trying out
--If Hayama has already

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:24.170
--some new material, aren'tcha?
--been over to my house,

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:26.250
--There must be some sup-uh
reason behind wearing that mask.
--then that means the secret is out.

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:27.710
--I'll bet there's some meaning
--That means there's
that much more reason

00:16:27.710 --> 00:16:29.420
--in those cheeks. Oh, Sana-chan,
--why I can't face him.

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:30.960
--are you rehoising for some new role?
--Ah! I'm going to have to

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:32.010
--What's this you've got
--live my whole life

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:33.880
--ov-uh your head now?
--without showing my face!

00:16:33.880 --> 00:16:36.140
Awl right, if I can be of any help,
I'll lend you a hand.

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:37.550
Is there some smawl part I can play?

00:16:37.550 --> 00:16:38.890
Maybe I should sing.

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:40.890
Oh, you're singing!? Hold on...!

00:16:40.890 --> 00:16:42.230
Here! How 'bout this?

00:16:42.230 --> 00:16:44.230
"You're going to sing here?"

00:16:44.230 --> 00:16:48.230
♪ Distraught Sana-chan;
what to do, Sana-chan? ♪

00:16:48.230 --> 00:16:50.230
I really am distraught.

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:52.240
♪ How can this be happening? ♪

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:54.570
♪ Sana-chan, what's wrong?
Fill us awl in. ♪

00:16:54.570 --> 00:16:56.570
♪ I just made this little faux pas. ♪

00:16:56.570 --> 00:16:58.580
♪ Faux pas, pawltry, parakeet! ♪

00:16:58.580 --> 00:17:00.580
♪ I really goofed up, and got kissed. ♪

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:02.250
♪ What's that, Sana-chan,
you got kissed-- ♪

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:04.000
Kissed!?

00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:06.040
Whoops...

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:06.960
Okay, ka-ching!

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:11.590
You don't need this any longer, right?

00:17:11.590 --> 00:17:13.590
I'm sorry, Rei-kun.

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:15.880
Sana-chan, there's nothing
you need to apologize for.

00:17:17.260 --> 00:17:18.600
You're not angry?

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:20.930
Of course not. I was
just worried about you.

00:17:20.930 --> 00:17:22.270
You love me?

00:17:22.270 --> 00:17:23.770
Mm-hmm, I love you.

00:17:25.270 --> 00:17:27.270
Thank goodness.

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:30.730
At first, Sana-chan, I thought you were
still upset about that other thing,

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:32.280
and were avoiding me.

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:34.860
Then Rei-kun, there isn't anything
between you and Asako-san?

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:35.860
No, no.

00:17:35.860 --> 00:17:37.200
You're not calling her?

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:38.530
No, no.

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:40.280
Is that right?

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:46.870
So, you're just collecting those
clippings of her out of fandom, right?

00:17:46.870 --> 00:17:48.880
Eep! She found out!

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:50.210
Uh-huh, that's right.

00:17:50.210 --> 00:17:52.800
I believe you, Rei-kun.

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:57.220
What is it you don't
understand about Hayama-kun?

00:17:57.220 --> 00:18:00.550
How could he kiss me, just because
I let my face get too close?

00:18:00.550 --> 00:18:03.560
Oh? So you don't know what that means.

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:06.230
What I do know is that
he is a kissing fiend!

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:08.900
Do you think a boy like
that would kiss just anyone?

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:10.900
No, I don't.

00:18:10.900 --> 00:18:14.360
That's not the way he looked to me.

00:18:18.240 --> 00:18:21.240
Our guest tonight is Kurumi Asako-san.

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:22.240
Good evening.

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:24.910
Thank you so much for taking time
out of your busy schedule for us.

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:26.580
Not at all. I watch
the show quite often.

00:18:26.580 --> 00:18:27.250
Oh, thank you so much.

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:31.250
--I saw the special
drama you were in earlier myself.
--Oh! S- Sana-chan! The TV! The TV!

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:34.550
Rei-kun! Rei-kun! Rei-kun!
Rei-kun! Rei-kun!

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:36.880
Would you come sleep with me?

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:38.550
Okay, ka-ching!

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:41.890
Sana-chan, there are a lot of
nice offers for work coming in.

00:18:41.890 --> 00:18:43.890
"Child's Toy" is all I want to do on TV.

00:18:43.890 --> 00:18:47.060
But look, here's one where you'd
play Asagiri Koji's younger sister.

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:48.230
That sure would be a delicious role.

00:18:48.230 --> 00:18:51.900
Well, I've already more than
kept my promise to Mama.

00:18:51.900 --> 00:18:53.230
Promise?

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:55.570
That's something I still can't
tell even you about, Rei-kun.

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:57.240
Good night!

00:18:57.240 --> 00:18:59.240
Oh, if there are any commercials,
I'll appear in those.

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:00.990
Okay.

00:19:02.240 --> 00:19:03.910
Oh, morning already!?

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:05.910
Good morning!

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:09.250
Rei-kun was understanding,
and doesn't mind it at all!

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:13.250
Love is strong!
Nothing can come between us!

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:16.090
Oh, hey, aren't you
the early one, Hayama-kun?

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:19.300
Hey, Hayama, don't you ignore me!

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:21.510
Or has your perversity powered up
to the next level today!?

00:19:22.590 --> 00:19:24.600
Well, he is at that "bankokki"
(international flags), after all.

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:26.430
You mean "hankoki" (rebellious age)?

00:19:30.270 --> 00:19:32.730
She's been hanging around there
for nearly 20 minutes now.

00:19:32.730 --> 00:19:34.190
It's a little creepy.

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:36.230
I wonder if she could be one
of the sensei's fans.

00:19:37.860 --> 00:19:39.070
WHO ARE YOU!?

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:42.530
Aren't you... Kurumi-san?

00:19:42.530 --> 00:19:43.870
Y- yes...

00:19:46.540 --> 00:19:48.870
Come on in.

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:49.870
--Sagami-kun...
--Yes?

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:52.210
You have a visitor. We're coming in.

00:19:58.210 --> 00:20:01.430
Hey, you sissy! If you've
got some kind of problem,

00:20:01.430 --> 00:20:03.220
then talk it out
and settle it right now!

00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:06.220
Okay, it's up to you now.
Take all the time you need.

00:20:06.220 --> 00:20:07.640
T- thanks...

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:16.190
Sana-chan said something about me being
the woman that started your misfortune,

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:17.230
didn't she?

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:21.570
Yes, yes, after you dumped me,
I flunked out of college.

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:23.820
But Rei, you hadn't
been studying at all

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:25.570
before I ever said
anything to you, right?

00:20:25.570 --> 00:20:29.240
That's right. But after that,
I lost my parents in an accident--

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:34.040
I thought that there would be money,
but they had quite a lot of debt,

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:35.880
and the house was taken from me.

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:38.880
At first, I went around
staying at friends' houses,

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:41.550
but that started to get demeaning,

00:20:41.550 --> 00:20:43.590
so I started wandering around,

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:46.090
and before I realized it, I had become
chummy with some homeless folks.

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:51.560
And that's my story.

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:54.520
I didn't know. But is that my fault?

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:56.980
No, it wasn't. I blamed
you instead of myself.

00:20:59.190 --> 00:21:01.860
I didn't dump you. I just
wanted a little time apart,

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:04.240
so I could become an actress,

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:06.620
and then stabilize my position
as an actress to a certain degree.

00:21:06.620 --> 00:21:07.530
That's what I told you.

00:21:07.570 --> 00:21:09.910
If you were serious, you should
have been able to handle doing both!

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:11.870
I wasn't able to!

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:14.870
I'm not that coordinated! I'm not
the kind of person who can do that!

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:16.880
You just don't say that
without even trying!

00:21:16.880 --> 00:21:18.210
You turned your back on me!

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:19.630
And how was I supposed
to believe you,

00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:21.880
when you told me out of the blue
that you wanted to be an actress?

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:24.550
It would be one thing if you had done
some things in the past, like Sana-chan,

00:21:24.550 --> 00:21:25.930
but you were just an
ordinary college girl!

00:21:25.930 --> 00:21:27.550
I became one!

00:21:27.590 --> 00:21:29.930
I became an actress.

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:32.600
Yes, you did. You surely did at that.

00:21:32.600 --> 00:21:34.520
That was really great of you!
You're so great! You're so great!

00:21:34.520 --> 00:21:35.560
I'm so surprised!

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:37.270
Rei...

00:21:40.610 --> 00:21:44.280
At any rate, right now, Sana-chan is
the most important thing to me.

00:21:44.280 --> 00:21:47.570
I can't think about you
at all right now.

00:21:47.610 --> 00:21:51.240
Now is no good? Then when will it be?

00:21:52.620 --> 00:21:54.080
Rei-kun...!

00:21:55.960 --> 00:21:58.250
Not until she's an adult.

00:21:58.250 --> 00:22:00.170
Can I wait for you?

00:22:02.630 --> 00:22:05.380
This is why I was avoiding you.

00:22:17.190 --> 00:22:19.190
Huh? A visitor?

00:22:20.860 --> 00:22:22.360
Asako-san...!

00:22:23.190 --> 00:22:26.530
Asako-san was here!?
Asako-san came to see you, Rei-kun!?

00:22:26.530 --> 00:22:29.200
She came inside the house!?
So, what is it with her!?

00:22:29.200 --> 00:22:34.160
No! No! Rei-kun,
you're my boyfriend, after all!

00:22:36.200 --> 00:22:39.120
I think it's about time...

00:22:40.710 --> 00:22:42.210
"Back against the wall."

00:22:42.710 --> 00:22:47.720
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:48.970 --> 00:22:52.470
In dire straits,

00:22:53.220 --> 00:22:56.060
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:56.560 --> 00:22:59.940
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:23:00.900 --> 00:23:05.030
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:05.230 --> 00:23:11.070
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:11.320 --> 00:23:13.280
...panic!!

00:23:14.330 --> 00:23:19.120
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:21.790
he's there.

00:23:22.710 --> 00:23:25.050
And our usual classroom...

00:23:25.250 --> 00:23:27.670
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:27.760 --> 00:23:30.180
...for two.

00:23:31.010 --> 00:23:33.640
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:33.850 --> 00:23:38.390
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:39.310 --> 00:23:41.980
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:42.190 --> 00:23:46.690
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:47.610 --> 00:23:52.280
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:52.450 --> 00:23:54.950
he's there,

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:58.120
And our usual classroom...

00:23:58.370 --> 00:24:00.710
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:24:00.830 --> 00:24:03.210
...for two.

00:24:06.920 --> 00:24:09.880
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:10.510 --> 00:24:13.180
Rei-kun... Rei-kun...

00:24:13.180 --> 00:24:16.850
Is my love just something
off the children's menu?

00:24:16.850 --> 00:24:21.350
No... no, it's not. I really
was in love with you, Rei-kun!

00:24:24.190 --> 00:24:28.860
Next time on Kodomo no Omocha,
Episode 10, vaya con Dios, mi amore:

00:24:28.860 --> 00:24:31.190
"Tweet-tweet, Love Flies Away"

00:24:31.190 --> 00:24:32.530
Adiós, señor.

00:24:32.530 --> 00:24:35.450
Huh!? You're really
laying it on today, huh?
